1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,629
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,629 --> 00:00:05,831
OTTO: Hey! That's not fair! Ivy didn't count!

3
00:00:06,031 --> 00:00:09,728
IVY: I didn't need to. I just saw it.

4
00:00:10,028 --> 00:00:13,866
Today's case: ladybird dots at a glance.

5
00:00:14,266 --> 00:00:19,848
OTTO: I'll count. One, two, three, four, five!

6
00:00:20,048 --> 00:00:23,343
IVY: Hmm. I saw four at a glance.

7
00:00:23,543 --> 00:00:25,611
OTTO: Four? You guessed!

8
00:00:26,011 --> 00:00:29,498
You can see small groups without counting.

9
00:00:30,098 --> 00:00:32,840
Two dots on this wing.

10
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,912
Two dots on that wing.

11
00:00:36,312 --> 00:00:39,251
Two and two make four.

12
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:41,995
It's B! Four dots.

13
00:00:42,195 --> 00:00:45,372
OTTO: Oh! I touched one dot twice!

14
00:00:45,772 --> 00:00:47,086
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

15
00:00:47,486 --> 00:00:53,640
Say it with me. You can see small groups without counting.

16
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:57,112
Next case: the shuffled clue cards.

